# ProjectClash iOS splash ad domain module
# Scope: splash ad domains only; app response rewrites live in per-app modules.
name: iOS 开屏广告域名拦截
desc: 拦截明确的开屏广告域名，不包含 MITM 或 App 响应改写
author: Anc9
category: AdBlock
version: 1.0.0
date: '2026-11-15'

rules:
- DOMAIN,ipm.atm.youku.com,REJECT
- DOMAIN,splashqqlive.gtimg.com,REJECT
- DOMAIN,poplayer.template.alibaba.com,REJECT
